# Generated agent surfaces (orcaops-managed). Prettier single-quotes the YAML
# frontmatter `generatedBy: "orcaops@<v>"` stamp, which doctor's
# double-quote-only staleness regex then reads as stale. These trees are emitted
# verbatim by `orcaops update` — never hand-formatted.
.claude/skills/
.claude/commands/
.agents/

# The committed install manifest is serialized canonically by the CLI
# (`JSON.stringify(manifest, null, 2)`). Prettier collapses its short arrays,
# and `orcaops update` then refuses to replace a file whose bytes no longer
# match what it planned against — every install manifest edit hard-fails until
# the file is hand-canonicalized.
.orcaops/install.json

# Root agent guides carry an orcaops-managed, marker-delimited `## Orcaops`
# section (<!-- orcaops:start --> … <!-- orcaops:end -->) emitted by
# `orcaops update`. Prettier reformatting the file drifts that managed block
# from the generator output (flap on `update --force`); the user content below
# the end marker is fine left unformatted.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# @orcaops/diff-render vendors third-party (MIT) diff-render source that must
# never be reformatted. The package formats its own authored files via its
# package-level .prettierignore + `pnpm --filter @orcaops/diff-render format`.
packages/diff-render/

# Compressed evidence — prettier cannot infer a parser and hard-errors, which
# fails `format:check` for the whole repo.
*.gz
